{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の夕方のゲリラ豪雨\nびっくりしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん大丈夫でしたか？。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は日傘があったから\nずぶ濡れにはならなかったけど\n地面から跳ね返ってきた雨雫や\n風に吹かれて流れてきて雨雫で少しぬれたけど\nちょっと楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小中学生の頃は\n学校帰りだと、もう帰るだけだからって\n雨の日の帰り道は傘をささなかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでびちょびちょになって\n家についてお風呂に直行するのが\n好きだった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、靴がぬれるのは面倒だったけど。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんふる雨をみると\n小さい頃青森に住んでた時に\n小樽おばあちゃんにおんぶされて\n妹を乳母車にのせて押しながら\nお兄ちゃんを幼稚園までむかえにいったことを時々思い出します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時のあの道を歩いてみる景色や\n雨の音も思い出せるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもなら、そんなに意識もせず通る道でも\nそういう時は意識しちゃいます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏にかけて夕立ちが増えていかと思うけど\n夕立ちってドキドキします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって！突然！\nその夕立ちの真上だけ雨降るんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、すごく大粒で大量の雨雫！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/05/7709525/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/05/7709525/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"より目がすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/05/7709525/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝からある番組のリハーサルをしてから\n生駒さんとBUBKAさんに取材をして頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月31日   発売！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAさん!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんと近況の話しや\n二期生が加入してからの乃木坂のはなし\n二期生のはなしなど対談っぽく\n話しました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話して改めて思いましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に素敵な先輩に恵まれたって思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なメンバーに恵まれた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ私は\nそんな素敵な人たちがあつまる\n素敵なグループを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変えたいと思いました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、記事を読めば伝わると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、みなさんみてくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/05/7709525/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/05/7709525/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きみちゃんとしろみちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちでしょー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のオーバーオールの前ポケットに\n入ったの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/05/7709525/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}